    {
      "passage_id": "SOR-2026-08-P079-S096",
      "quote": "The draw of the athletes will be done by means of software on a laptop, one (1) hour before the start of the competition. This will be done at the place of the IJF IT person running the competition. Four athletes per category (except those that are plus categories) will be drawn.",
